{"id":"fmhhfrxzu09dzp82kok512uxx","title":"某研究者提出PTOP模型解析技术搜索机制","originalTitle":"Technology as a Search Problem","summary":"PTOP模型将技术发展视为高维搜索空间，通过模块化设计（如分阶段验证组件）和现象触发机制（如利用物理定律组合实现目标）大幅缩小可行方案数量。实验显示，模块化搜索可将1亿种可能压缩至1300次尝试，而引入并行现象（如光 bulb 的温度与热膨胀协同）则需权衡不同性能指标。研究对比了有性/无性繁殖策略在技术迭代中的效率差异，证明后者能将研发周期从2000代缩短至100代。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Hacker News 热榜"},"links":{"original":"https://www.construction-physics.com/p/technology-as-a-search-problem"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-13T19:27:15.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-13T20:36:23.008Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-13T20:36:23.008Z","category":null,"tags":["技术方案"],"score":51,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"5d10b1e9-a37e-471f-965d-55b91e48e901","title":"PTOP模型提出技术搜索新框架"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"5d10b1e9-a37e-471f-965d-55b91e48e901","title":"PTOP模型提出技术搜索新框架"}],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"f8NZk-burfi8","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}